abstract: >-
  R and Python code, matching and estimation pipeline, and derived estimate
  tables for a global quasi-experimental evaluation of terrestrial protected
  areas designated 2001-2020 against 14 mapped anthropogenic threats, with
  protected-area-level stochastic frontier analysis of performance gaps and
  species-range estimates for threatened terrestrial vertebrates.
